false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"## Bug Report\r\n### Current Behavior\r\nWe currently don't have any error messaging for some descriptions in the front matter fields. This usually happens if it's an edge case title we don't account for, like this:\r\n```\r\n---\r\ntitle: [something] Square brackets work here...\r\npublished: false\r\ndescription: [something] But not in the description\r\ntags: markdown, writing\r\n---\r\n```\r\n\r\nHitting preview simply doesn't do anything, and hitting save actually hits the 500 page.\r\n### Expected Behavior\r\n1. We should account for square brackets, probably by wrapping the description with quotation marks.\r\n2. We should add error messaging if preview hits a 500 response.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/692/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/692/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2018925960,"node_id":"MDE1Ok1pbGVzdG9uZWRFdmVudDIwMTg5MjU5NjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/events/2018925960","actor":{"login":"jessleenyc","id":14931921,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTMxOTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14931921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessleenyc","html_url":"https://github.com/jessleenyc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessleenyc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessleenyc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessleenyc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessleenyc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessleenyc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessleenyc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessleenyc/repos","events_ur